{"claim_id": "CLM-C02-0068", "company_id": "COMPANY_02", "axis_id": "AXIS_14", "topic_id": "AXIS_14_T01", "question_id": "Q-C02-A14-T01-01", "claim_type": "FACT", "statement": "三菱商事の連結（IFRS）FY2025は、収益18,915,995百万円、売上総利益1,655,074百万円、当社所有者帰属当期純利益800,460百万円（前期950,709百万円）、当社所有者帰属持分9,440,567百万円、総資産24,151,695百万円、ROE 8.5%（前期10.3%）、持分比率39.1%。", "evidence": [{"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0232", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0233", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0234", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0235", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0236", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0237", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0238", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}], "valid_from": null, "valid_to": null, "validity": "HISTORICAL_IMMUTABLE", "info_class": "AUDITED_FINANCIAL", "snapshot": "asof_2026-11-01", "notes": "", "recorded_at": "2026-11-10T21:19:49+09:00"}
{"claim_id": "CLM-C02-0069", "company_id": "COMPANY_02", "axis_id": "AXIS_14", "topic_id": "AXIS_14_T08", "question_id": "Q-C02-A14-T08-01", "claim_type": "ANALYSIS", "statement": "JCRがセクターレポートで集計した三菱商事の数値は有報と一致する。収益18兆9,160億円、最終利益8,005億円（前期9,507億円）、ネット有利子負債3兆8,882億円、自己資本9兆4,406億円、ネットDER0.41倍（38,882÷94,406）。JCRの『営業利益4,186億円（前期3,711億円）』は有報の売上総利益16,551億円から販管費12,365億円を引いた値に等しい（前期は18,364−14,653＝3,711）。IFRSの三菱商事は営業利益を開示しておらず、JCRの営業利益は同社の定義による加工値とみられる。JCRの数値は会社開示の転記で、独立した検証ではない。", "evidence": [{"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0239", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0240", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0241", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0242", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0243", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0244", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0015", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0016", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0017", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0018", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0019", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0026", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}], "valid_from": null, "valid_to": null, "validity": "HISTORICAL_IMMUTABLE", "info_class": null, "snapshot": "asof_2026-11-01", "notes": "JCRの営業利益の定義はレポートに記載がなく、一致は算術上の照合。", "recorded_at": "2026-11-10T21:19:49+09:00"}
{"claim_id": "CLM-C02-0070", "company_id": "COMPANY_02", "axis_id": "AXIS_14", "topic_id": "AXIS_14_T02", "question_id": null, "claim_type": "FACT", "statement": "三菱商事のFY2025の営業活動によるキャッシュ・フローは1兆4,900億円（前期1兆6,583億円）、投資活動は△4,486億円でフリーキャッシュ・フローは1兆414億円。同社が独自に定義する営業収益キャッシュ・フロー（運転資金の増減を除きリース負債支払額を反映）は1兆481億円（前期9,837億円）。", "evidence": [{"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0245", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0246", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0247", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0248", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0249", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}], "valid_from": null, "valid_to": null, "validity": "HISTORICAL_IMMUTABLE", "info_class": "AUDITED_FINANCIAL", "snapshot": "asof_2026-11-01", "notes": "", "recorded_at": "2026-11-10T21:19:49+09:00"}
{"claim_id": "CLM-C02-0071", "company_id": "COMPANY_02", "axis_id": "AXIS_14", "topic_id": "AXIS_14_T04", "question_id": "Q-C02-A14-T04-01", "claim_type": "FACT", "statement": "三菱商事は2025年4月3日の取締役会で上限1兆円の自己株式取得を決議し、公開買付け（1株2,291円、93,109,311株）と市場買付けで318,397,611株・999,999百万円を取得した（取得株式は提出日までに消却）。FY2025の1株当たり配当は110円（中間55円・期末55円、総額411,379百万円）で、累進配当と機動的な自己株式取得を基本方針とする。", "evidence": [{"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0250", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0251", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0252", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0253", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0254", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0255", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0256", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}], "valid_from": null, "valid_to": null, "validity": "HISTORICAL_IMMUTABLE", "info_class": "AUDITED_FINANCIAL", "snapshot": "asof_2026-11-01", "notes": "", "recorded_at": "2026-11-10T21:19:49+09:00"}
{"claim_id": "CLM-C02-0072", "company_id": "COMPANY_02", "axis_id": "AXIS_14", "topic_id": "AXIS_14_T04", "question_id": "Q-C02-A14-T04-02", "claim_type": "ANALYSIS", "statement": "FY2025に三菱商事が株主に支払った現金は、配当405,973百万円と自己株式の取得（純額）1,002,720百万円の計1,408,693百万円で、フリーキャッシュ・フロー1兆414億円を約3,670億円上回った。同期に長期借入債務等で1,386,789百万円を調達し490,155百万円を返済しており、ネット有利子負債は3兆472億円から3兆8,882億円に増えた。株主還元の一部は借入に支えられたと読める（ただし借入には投資資金の手当ても含まれ、使途は区別できない）。", "evidence": [{"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0257", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0258", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0247", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0259", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0260", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0243", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}], "valid_from": null, "valid_to": null, "validity": "HISTORICAL_IMMUTABLE", "info_class": null, "snapshot": "asof_2026-11-01", "notes": "借入の使途別内訳は非開示。期末の現金は3,048億円増加しており、借入の一部は手元資金として残った。", "recorded_at": "2026-11-10T21:19:49+09:00"}
{"claim_id": "CLM-C02-0073", "company_id": "COMPANY_02", "axis_id": "AXIS_14", "topic_id": "AXIS_14_T03", "question_id": "Q-C02-A14-T03-01", "claim_type": "FACT", "statement": "三菱商事はFY2025に、三菱自動車工業への投資で35,741百万円の減損を計上し、マテリアルソリューションではサウディ石油化学・基礎化学事業と機能素材事業で減損があった。前年度（FY2024）には国内洋上風力発電事業の共同支配企業への投資で、インフレ、円安、サプライチェーンの逼迫、金利上昇等を背景に持分法損益で51,255百万円、有価証券損益で1,183百万円の損失を計上した。", "evidence": [{"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0164", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0154", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0261", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0262", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0045", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0263", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}], "valid_from": null, "valid_to": null, "validity": "HISTORICAL_IMMUTABLE", "info_class": "AUDITED_FINANCIAL", "snapshot": "asof_2026-11-01", "notes": "", "recorded_at": "2026-11-10T21:19:49+09:00"}
{"claim_id": "CLM-C02-0074", "company_id": "COMPANY_02", "axis_id": "AXIS_14", "topic_id": "AXIS_14_T07", "question_id": "Q-C02-A14-T07-01", "claim_type": "FACT", "statement": "三菱商事のFY2025末のグロス有利子負債（リース負債除く）は4兆6,170億円から5兆7,469億円、ネット有利子負債は3兆472億円から3兆8,882億円に増えた。長期資金比率は79%（前期77%）、流動比率は141%（前期149%）。経営戦略2027ではネットDER0.6倍を上限の目処としている。", "evidence": [{"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0264", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0243", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0265", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0266", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0267", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}], "valid_from": null, "valid_to": null, "validity": "HISTORICAL_IMMUTABLE", "info_class": "AUDITED_FINANCIAL", "snapshot": "asof_2026-11-01", "notes": "", "recorded_at": "2026-11-10T21:19:49+09:00"}
{"claim_id": "CLM-C02-0075", "company_id": "COMPANY_02", "axis_id": "AXIS_14", "topic_id": "AXIS_14_T07", "question_id": null, "claim_type": "ANALYSIS", "statement": "三菱商事のネットDERはFY2025末に約0.41倍（ネット有利子負債38,882億円÷当社所有者帰属持分94,406億円）、前期末は約0.33倍（30,472÷93,687）で、上限目処0.6倍まで約0.19倍の余地がある。持分94,406億円を前提に単純計算すると、ネットDER0.6倍に達するまでの追加ネット負債は約1兆8,000億円。", "evidence": [{"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0243", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0244", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0268", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}], "valid_from": null, "valid_to": null, "validity": "HISTORICAL_IMMUTABLE", "info_class": null, "snapshot": "asof_2026-11-01", "notes": "三菱商事は有報で実績のネットDERを開示していない（計算値）。0.6×94,406−38,882≈17,762億円。持分は為替・利益・還元で変動する。", "recorded_at": "2026-11-10T21:19:49+09:00"}
{"claim_id": "CLM-C02-0076", "company_id": "COMPANY_02", "axis_id": "AXIS_14", "topic_id": "AXIS_14_T05", "question_id": null, "claim_type": "FACT", "statement": "三菱商事のFY2025の持分法による投資損益は467,941百万円（前期337,482百万円）で、セグメント別では地球環境エネルギー103,670、金属資源122,995、S.L.C. 98,551、社会インフラ59,678、モビリティ45,485、食品産業22,685、電力ソリューション16,003、マテリアルソリューション△1,188（百万円）。", "evidence": [{"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0269", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0270", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}], "valid_from": null, "valid_to": null, "validity": "HISTORICAL_IMMUTABLE", "info_class": "AUDITED_FINANCIAL", "snapshot": "asof_2026-11-01", "notes": "", "recorded_at": "2026-11-10T21:19:49+09:00"}
{"claim_id": "CLM-C02-0077", "company_id": "COMPANY_02", "axis_id": "AXIS_14", "topic_id": "AXIS_14_T06", "question_id": "Q-C02-A14-T06-01", "claim_type": "FACT", "statement": "三菱商事は2024年8月15日、KDDIによるローソン株式の公開買付けとスクイーズアウトを経てKDDIと出資比率を50%ずつに調整し、ローソンの単独支配を失って共同支配企業に分類した。前年度にこの支配喪失に伴い残存持分の再測定益など182,070百万円を計上し、ローソンが保有していた現預金457,961百万円が連結から外れた。FY2025末のローソン宛て投資の帳簿価額は5,026億円。", "evidence": [{"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0271", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0272", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0273", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0274", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0275", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}], "valid_from": null, "valid_to": null, "validity": "HISTORICAL_IMMUTABLE", "info_class": "AUDITED_FINANCIAL", "snapshot": "asof_2026-11-01", "notes": "", "recorded_at": "2026-11-10T21:19:49+09:00"}
{"claim_id": "CLM-C02-0078", "company_id": "COMPANY_02", "axis_id": "AXIS_14", "topic_id": "AXIS_14_T02", "question_id": "Q-C02-A14-T02-01", "claim_type": "ANALYSIS", "statement": "FY2025の当期純利益（当社所有者帰属）の減少1,502億円は、主に前年度の一過性利益の反動による。有価証券損益は3,056億円から418億円（ローソン持分法化に伴う再評価益の反動）、固定資産除・売却損益は1,346億円から△93億円（豪州原料炭の炭鉱売却益の反動）に減り、法人所得税は再評価益への税効果の反動で1,378億円軽くなった。一方、持分法損益は銅事業の減損戻入れと前年の洋上風力損失の反動で1,305億円増えた。資源価格による減益（金属資源△233億円等）より、一過性要因の振れの方が大きい。", "evidence": [{"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0276", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0277", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0278", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0279", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0280", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0281", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0242", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0036", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}], "valid_from": null, "valid_to": null, "validity": "HISTORICAL_IMMUTABLE", "info_class": null, "snapshot": "asof_2026-11-01", "notes": "", "recorded_at": "2026-11-10T21:19:49+09:00"}
